# REN by TeamAIN — Master Product Development Specification

## 1. Project Overview

You are working as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, AI architect, SaaS product strategist, and hospitality technology specialist for TeamAIN.

We are developing an application called **Ren**, an AI-powered guest experience and hotel operations platform designed primarily for independent hotels, boutique hotels, smaller resorts, motels, and small hotel management companies.

Large hotel brands have access to sophisticated proprietary systems for guest communication, service requests, operational management, guest recovery, and performance analytics. Independent hotels often lack access to comparable resources or cannot justify the associated expenses.

Our mission is to democratize hospitality technology by making sophisticated hotel operational tools affordable, accessible, intuitive, and easy to implement.

**Our guiding philosophy:**

Ren is not designed to replace hospitality professionals. It is designed to give them more time to be hospitality professionals.

**Brand positioning:**

Ren — The intelligent operating companion for independent hotels.

Big-brand technology. Independent hotel simplicity.

