## 14. Human Takeover

Human takeover must be an explicit, reliable application state.

Use conversation states such as:

- AI Active.
- Awaiting Human Assistance.
- Human Active.
- AI Assist Mode.
- Resolved.
- Archived.

When an associate selects "Take Over":

- Change the conversation state on the backend.
- Stop automatic AI responses.
- Assign the conversation to the associate.
- Notify the guest appropriately.
- Prevent simultaneous AI and human replies.
- Continue displaying incoming guest messages in real time.

When staff returns control to Ren:

- Notify the guest where appropriate.
- Restore automated AI responses.
- Provide Ren with relevant conversation context.
- Preserve all previous conversation history.

Ren may offer AI-generated suggested replies to associates while a human controls the conversation.

Suggested replies must not automatically send unless the associate explicitly authorizes them.

