Example defaults:

| Request category | Illustrative target |
|---|---|
| Towels | 15 minutes |
| Toiletries | 15 minutes |
| Housekeeping inquiry | 20 minutes |
| Routine engineering | 30 minutes |
| Air conditioning issue | 20 minutes |
