These targets are configurable internal expectations, not guaranteed guest delivery times.

Track both acknowledgment time and fulfillment time.

Notifications may include:

- In-app notifications.
- Browser push notifications.
- Email.
- Mobile web push where supported.
- Optional SMS through configured integrations.

Allow administrators to configure recipients and escalation chains.

Example:

- New towel request: notify housekeeping.
- Request not acknowledged within five minutes: notify housekeeping supervisor.
- Request exceeds its target: notify department manager.
- Critical incident: immediately notify designated management and security personnel.

Implement retries and delivery tracking.

Do not claim that a notification was delivered when delivery has failed.

